---
import Breadcrumbs from "@/components/common/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import { aiCareerPath, localePath, withBase } from "@/config/site";
import { careers } from "@/data/careers";
import { t } from "@/lib/i18n";
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import type { Locale } from "@/types/content";
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const bn = locale === "bn";
---

<BaseLayout
  locale={locale}
  title={bn ? "AI ও তোমার CSE Career" : "AI & Your CSE Career"}
  description={bn
    ? "Fake replacement percentage নয়—Task Automation Exposure, durable capability আর AI দিয়ে শেখার safe practice।"
    : "Understand Task Automation Exposure, durable capabilities and how to learn with AI without fake replacement percentages or dependency."}
>
  <Breadcrumbs
    locale={locale}
    items={[{ label: bn ? "AI ও career" : "AI & Your Career" }]}
  />
  <header class="page-hero container">
    <p class="eyebrow">{bn ? "AI resilience" : "AI resilience"}</p><h1>
      {
        bn
          ? "AI programmer-কে শুধু replace করছে—এত সহজ গল্প না।"
          : "“AI replaces programmers” is too simple to be useful."
      }
    </h1><p class="lede">
      {
        bn
          ? "AI বদলাচ্ছে programmer-কে কোন কাজের জন্য paid করা হয়। Career-কে indivisible job না ভেবে task, judgment, context আর responsibility-র bundle হিসেবে দেখো।"
          : "AI is changing what programmers are paid to do. Treat a career as a bundle of tasks, judgment, context and responsibility—not one indivisible job."
      }
    </p>
  </header>
  <section class="section ai-thesis">
    <div class="container editorial-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">
          {bn ? "দুইটা bad strategy" : "Two bad strategies"}
        </p><h2>
          {
            bn
              ? "Ignore না। Panic-ও না।"
              : "Do not ignore it. Do not panic either."
          }
        </h2>
      </div><div>
        <p>
          {
            bn
              ? "Boilerplate, syntax conversion, routine CRUD আর basic documentation-এর cost কমছে। একই সঙ্গে verification, architecture, debugging, integration, security, domain knowledge আর ownership-এর shape বদলাচ্ছে।"
              : "Boilerplate, syntax conversion, routine CRUD and basic documentation are getting cheaper. Verification, architecture, debugging, integration, security, domain knowledge and ownership are changing shape."
          }
        </p><div class="callout callout--warm">
          <p class="callout__label">{bn ? "AI reality" : "AI reality"}</p><p>
            {
              bn
                ? "AI capability evolve করে। নিচের exposure label permanent safety claim নয়—আজকের learning decision-এর lens।"
                : "AI capabilities evolve. Exposure labels are not permanent safety claims; they are a lens for today’s learning decisions."
            }
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--tinted">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head task-model-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">{bn ? "Task model" : "Task model"}</p><h2>
            {
              bn
                ? "Higher exposure → AI-assisted → responsibility-heavy"
                : "Higher exposure → AI-assisted → responsibility-heavy"
            }
          </h2>
        </div><p class="lede">
          {
            bn
              ? "Lower exposure মানে ‘AI-proof’ নয়। Context, accountability আর consequence বেশি—এই মুহূর্তে শুধু সেটাই বোঝায়।"
              : "Lower exposure never means AI-proof. It means context, accountability and consequences currently matter more."
          }
        </p>
      </div><div class="exposure">
        <article class="exposure__item" data-level="higher">
          <span class="tag">higher</span><h3>
            {bn ? "Routine production" : "Routine production"}
          </h3><p>
            {
              bn
                ? "Boilerplate, syntax conversion, basic tests, familiar CRUD, first-draft docs।"
                : "Boilerplate, syntax conversion, basic tests, familiar CRUD and first-draft documentation."
            }
          </p>
        </article><article class="exposure__item" data-level="medium">
          <span class="tag">medium</span><h3>
            {bn ? "AI-assisted judgment" : "AI-assisted judgment"}
          </h3><p>
            {
              bn
                ? "Architecture option, debugging hypothesis, database model, test strategy, integration আর security review।"
                : "Architecture options, debugging hypotheses, database models, test strategy, integration and security review."
            }
          </p>
        </article><article class="exposure__item" data-level="lower">
          <span class="tag">lower</span><h3>
            {bn ? "Context ও responsibility" : "Context and responsibility"}
          </h3><p>
            {
              bn
                ? "Actual problem বোঝা, stakeholder trade-off, risk, domain expertise, production ownership আর verification।"
                : "Understanding the actual problem, stakeholder trade-offs, risk, domain expertise, production ownership and verification."
            }
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">
            {bn ? "AI-native, AI-dependent না" : "AI-native, not AI-dependent"}
          </p><h2>
            {
              bn
                ? "‘AI code লিখে দিয়েছে’ থেকে ‘result আমি verify করেছি’"
                : "Move from “AI wrote it” to “I verified the result”"
            }
          </h2>
        </div><p class="lede">
          {
            bn
              ? "Speed useful, কিন্তু independent reasoning deliberately practice না করলে speed borrowed capability হয়ে যায়।"
              : "Speed is useful. Without deliberate independent reasoning, that speed becomes borrowed capability."
          }
        </p>
      </div><ol class="capability-path">
        {
          (bn
            ? [
                "Problem আর success criteria নিজে explain করো।",
                "Foundation-এর selected exercise AI ছাড়া solve করো।",
                "AI-কে option আর critique-এর জন্য use করো।",
                "Correctness, complexity, edge case আর security verify করো।",
                "Failure debug আর trade-off own করো।",
                "Result-এর consequence-এর responsibility নাও।",
              ]
            : [
                "Explain the problem and success criteria yourself.",
                "Solve selected foundational exercises without AI.",
                "Use AI to generate options and critique—not authority.",
                "Verify correctness, complexity, edge cases and security.",
                "Debug failures and own trade-offs.",
                "Take responsibility for the consequences of the result.",
              ]
          ).map((item, index) => (
            <li>
              <>
                <span>{index + 1}</span>
                <p>{item}</p>
              </>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--tinted">
    <div class="container editorial-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">{bn ? "Practice modes" : "Practice modes"}</p><h2>
          {
            bn
              ? "AI-free reasoning + AI-assisted review"
              : "AI-free reasoning + AI-assisted review"
          }
        </h2>
      </div><div>
        <article class="mode">
          <h3>
            {bn ? "AI-Free Problem Solving" : "AI-Free Problem Solving"}
          </h3><p>
            {
              bn
                ? "Foundation reasoning, debugging আর recall-এর selected session। Goal purity না—নিজের capability measure করা।"
                : "Selected sessions for foundational reasoning, debugging and recall. The goal is not purity; it is measuring your own capability."
            }
          </p>
        </article><article class="mode">
          <h3>{bn ? "AI-Assisted Review" : "AI-Assisted Review"}</h3><p>
            {
              bn
                ? "AI solution নাও, তারপর bug, complexity problem, counterexample, security gap আর simpler alternative খোঁজো।"
                : "Take an AI solution, then find a bug, complexity issue, counterexample, security gap and simpler alternative."
            }
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">
            {bn ? "Career-specific exposure" : "Career-specific exposure"}
          </p><h2>
            {bn ? "একই AI, আলাদা task mix" : "Same AI, different task mix"}
          </h2>
        </div><p class="lede">
          {
            bn
              ? "নিজের target career খুলে কোন task automate হচ্ছে আর কোন capability deliberateভাবে build করবে দেখো।"
              : "Open a target career to see which tasks are exposed and which capabilities deserve deliberate practice."
          }
        </p>
      </div><div class="career-ai-list">
        {
          careers.map((career) => (
            <a
              href={withBase(aiCareerPath(locale, career.slug))}
              data-track-event="ai_guidance_viewed"
              data-track-param-career-id={career.id}
            >
              <>
                <strong>{t(career.title, locale)}</strong>
                <span>
                  {career.aiExposure.map((item) => item.exposure).join(" · ")}
                </span>
                <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>
              </>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--tinted">
    <div class="container callout">
      <p class="callout__label">{bn ? "Next step" : "Next step"}</p><h2>
        {
          bn
            ? "একটা career choose করে তিনটি exposure task explain করো।"
            : "Choose one career and explain its three exposure tasks."
        }
      </h2><p>
        {
          bn
            ? "তারপর একটি AI-free foundation exercise আর একটি AI-assisted review করো। Panic-এর জায়গায় evidence আসবে।"
            : "Then do one AI-free foundation exercise and one AI-assisted review. Evidence replaces panic."
        }
      </p><a class="button" href={withBase(localePath(locale, "/careers/"))}
        >{bn ? "Career বেছে নিই" : "Choose a career"}</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .ai-thesis {
    background: var(--color-text);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }
  .ai-thesis .eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-inverse-warm);
  }
  .ai-thesis .callout__label {
    color: var(--color-inverse-amber);
  }
  .ai-thesis .callout {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 9%, transparent);
  }
  .capability-path {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    list-style: none;
  }
  .capability-path li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.3rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .capability-path span {
    color: var(--color-warm);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .capability-path p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .mode {
    padding: 1.2rem 0;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
  }
  .career-ai-list {
    display: grid;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }
  .career-ai-list a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 0.2rem 1rem;
    min-height: 4.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.8rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .career-ai-list span {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .career-ai-list b {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  @media (min-width: 68rem) {
    .task-model-head {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
    }
    .task-model-head h2 {
      max-width: none;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.3vw, 2.5rem);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .task-model-head .lede {
      max-width: 48rem;
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
